      "text": "Activity 3. Listen and complete the conversation."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7000,
      "end_ms": 11500,
      "text": "Tina, I'll pick you up at the school gate at five."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12420,
      "end_ms": 18100,
      "text": "Okay mum, but can you change your clothes before you come?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 18920,
      "end_ms": 25880,
      "text": "Why? I don't have time to change after work. I don't want to be late."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 25880,
      "end_ms": 33180,
      "text": "It's a bit difficult to talk about, but that is too eye-catching."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 34100,
      "end_ms": 38840,
      "text": "Oh, Tina, don't you love my queen's dress?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 39840,
      "end_ms": 46560,
      "text": "Not now. I'm not a little girl anymore. Everyone looks at you and laughs."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47380,
      "end_ms": 57780,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I didn't know that. Now I see. I will change my clothes before I pick you up."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 58460,
      "end_ms": 61920,
      "text": "Thank you, Mum. I hope you're not hurt."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62680,
      "end_ms": 65780,
      "text": "I am glad you told me this, my girl."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 74300,
      "end_ms": 81320,
